## Design Tokens — Single Source of Truth

**Never invent one-off hex colors in new code.** Map Figma fills/strokes to existing tokens.

### Color & theme (priority order)

1. **CSS variables** — `frontend/src/app/globals.css` (`--background`, `--primary`, `--accent`, `--border`, gradients).
2. **Tailwind semantic classes** — `bg-background`, `text-primary`, `border-border`, `bg-card`, etc. (`tailwind.config.ts` maps to CSS vars).
3. **TS constants** — `frontend/src/styles/theme.ts` (`colors`, `shadows`, `layout`) for JS/inline styles and Framer.
4. **Domain palettes** — `frontend/src/lib/constants.ts`: `RARITY_TIERS`, `BRANCHES`, `DIFFICULTY_RATINGS`, `FARMING_FLAGS`, `SCORE_DIMENSIONS`.

### Figma → code color map

| Figma role | Token / class |
|------------|----------------|
| Page background | `bg-background` / `#0A0B10` |
| Card / panel | `bg-card` / `panelDark` |
| Primary CTA / XP / success | `primary` / `arcadeGreen` / `#10B981` |
| Accent / epic | `accent` / `neonPurple` |
| Destructive / farming | `destructive` |
| Muted text | `text-muted-foreground` |
| Legendary / gold | `legendary-gold`, `gradient-legendary`, `rarity-legendary` |
| Branch accents | `branch-{educator,builder,creator,scout,diplomat}` or `BRANCHES` |

### Typography

Loaded in `frontend/src/lib/fonts.ts`, applied on root layout via `fontVariables`:

| Role | Font | Tailwind / utility | Use for |
|------|------|-------------------|---------|
| Display | Press Start 2P | `font-display` | Logo, hero numbers, **score totals only** — never body copy |
| Heading | Space Grotesk | `font-heading` | Section titles, card headings |
| Body | DM Sans | `font-body` | Prose, buttons, forms |
| Mono | JetBrains Mono | `font-mono` | Scores, labels, addresses, overlines (`tracking-widest`, `uppercase`) |

Scores and counters: add class `tabular` for aligned digits.

### Spacing & layout

- Max content width: `1200px` / `max-w-[960px]` hero, `layout.maxWidth` in `theme.ts`.
- Section vertical rhythm: `~6rem` (`layout.sectionGap`) between landing sections.
- Page padding: `px-4 sm:px-6` mobile, `2rem` desktop.
- Radius: `rounded-[var(--radius)]` (0.375rem) — do not introduce new radii without updating `--radius`.

### Effects (Arcade RPG)

- **CRT:** `CrtOverlay` or `.crt-scanlines` — marketing heroes and `ScoreCard`.
- **Glow:** `.glow-green`, `.glow-purple`, `shadow-[0_0_20px_hsl(160_80%_40%/0.3)]` on primary actions (match `ArcadeButton` / shadcn `Button` default).
- **Screen glow:** `.screen-glow` or `ArcadeCard glow`.
- **Grid texture:** radial dot grid at low opacity (see `HeroSection`) — optional, do not overpower content.

**Dark mode only.** Do not design or implement light theme variants.

