## Shared Patterns (Marketing ↔ App)

These must stay visually aligned during the refresh:

| Pattern | Marketing | App | Shared implementation |
|---------|-----------|-----|-------------------------|
| AI Judge score | `AiJudgeDemo`, `ScoreReveal` | `ScoreCard`, `(app)/judge` | Same dimensions, farming badge, CRT, bar colors from `SCORE_DIMENSIONS` |
| Wallet CTA | `Navigation`, `WaitlistForm` steps | `WalletButton`, `AuthGuard` | Particle ConnectKit + SIWE via `useWeb3Auth` / `WalletButton` |
| Quest metaphor | `QuestChain`, copy sections | `QuestCard`, `(app)/quests` | `DifficultyBadge`, branch borders |
| XP / progress | Social proof counters | `XpBar`, profile | `xp-bar-track` / `xp-bar-fill` classes or `XpBar` |

When Figma shows a “score card” or “quest card” on the landing page, **extend or reuse** the app component with props — do not fork a second visual system.

