## Anti-Patterns (do not)

- Light theme or white gray SaaS cards without arcade border/glow
- Inter/Roboto/system fonts for marketing or app UI
- Press Start 2P for paragraphs or form labels
- New duplicate `ScoreCard` styling on landing only
- Editing `components/ui/*` shadcn sources
- One-off animation timings outside `animations.ts` / `theme.ts` scales
- Generic blue/purple gradient hero unrelated to `--gradient-hero`

